2. In this Order —
“eligible parking place” has the meaning given by rule 4 of the Parking Places (Parking of Heavy Vehicles — Lodgement) Rules 2026 (G.N. No. S 609/2026);
“registered owner”, in relation to a heavy vehicle, means the person who is registered under the Road Traffic Act 1961 as the owner of the heavy vehicle.
